{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43275","headline":"春水绿波 · 朱休","name":"春水绿波","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳时淑气和，春水澹烟波。\n滉瀁滋兰杜，沦涟长芰荷。\n晚光扶翠潋，潭影写青莎。\n归雁追飞尽，纤鳞游泳多。\n朝宗终到海，润下每盈科。\n愿假中流便，从兹发櫂歌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43275.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43275","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}